    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1\u20135 player co-op survival horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a wild jungle, with no clues about what\u2019s going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the gaps in the trees, you see that you're surrounded by towering walls. The gate opens at dawn and closes at night. You must gather enough supplies and build a base in this relatively safe forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just to keep warm and fed,<br>but to have shelter when monsters come to invade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/1c6887bb761ebe5e59d023d3c34c1f9c.poster.webp?t=1752902071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/1c6887bb761ebe5e59d023d3c34c1f9c.webp?t=1752902071\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're well prepared, venture into the maze filled with unknown dangers.<br>There, you\u2019ll need to gather vital materials, solve complex puzzles, leave markers, and try to push your exploration as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/6dd8c33ef76f83c098ff187fb3f68a3c.poster.webp?t=1752902071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/6dd8c33ef76f83c098ff187fb3f68a3c.webp?t=1752902071\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware \u2014 the real threat lies in the maze itself.<br>You\u2019ll face not only bizarre creatures like aliens and giant spiders,<br>but also terrifying entities like ghosts, spirits that teleport to you when they hear your voice, and relentless cube-like monsters that will hunt you without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/035d6f0f63c5a9e405028876c79aced6.poster.webp?t=1752902071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/035d6f0f63c5a9e405028876c79aced6.webp?t=1752902071\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There seems to be a mysterious force behind the maze, constantly interfering with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go now \u2014 see if you can escape.<br>And if you can\u2019t\u2026<br>do your best to leave clues for the next ones who enter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead and see if you can escape. If not, try to leave something behind for those who come after you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1\u20135 player co-op survival horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a wild jungle, with no clues about what\u2019s going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the gaps in the trees, you see that you're surrounded by towering walls. The gate opens at dawn and closes at night. You must gather enough supplies and build a base in this relatively safe forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just to keep warm and fed,<br>but to have shelter when monsters come to invade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/1c6887bb761ebe5e59d023d3c34c1f9c.poster.webp?t=1752902071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/1c6887bb761ebe5e59d023d3c34c1f9c.webp?t=1752902071\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're well prepared, venture into the maze filled with unknown dangers.<br>There, you\u2019ll need to gather vital materials, solve complex puzzles, leave markers, and try to push your exploration as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/6dd8c33ef76f83c098ff187fb3f68a3c.poster.webp?t=1752902071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/6dd8c33ef76f83c098ff187fb3f68a3c.webp?t=1752902071\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware \u2014 the real threat lies in the maze itself.<br>You\u2019ll face not only bizarre creatures like aliens and giant spiders,<br>but also terrifying entities like ghosts, spirits that teleport to you when they hear your voice, and relentless cube-like monsters that will hunt you without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/035d6f0f63c5a9e405028876c79aced6.poster.webp?t=1752902071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812670/extras/035d6f0f63c5a9e405028876c79aced6.webp?t=1752902071\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There seems to be a mysterious force behind the maze, constantly interfering with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go now \u2014 see if you can escape.<br>And if you can\u2019t\u2026<br>do your best to leave clues for the next ones who enter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead and see if you can escape. If not, try to leave something behind for those who come after you.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Maze Survivor is a limited space survival game that uniquely combines the characteristics of survival, horror, puzzle solving and maze adventure games. Players will wake up in the center of a complex maze without any clues. Let's try to see if they can survive and escape from this strange maze.",
